# The frontend needs no environment variables, in development or in the image.
#
# It calls the relative path /api. In development Vite proxies that to the
# backend on :5000; in production the frontend's nginx proxies /api and /uploads
# to the backend service (see nginx.conf). The public address is configured on
# the backend (FRONTEND_URL in the root .env), not here.
#
# VITE_API_URL, which this file used to list, is not read by anything.
